<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\風呂.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>A big tub, and little me in it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I let my arms and legs go slack, looked up at the ceiling, and gave myself over to buoyancy and gravity.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The floating feeling was pleasant.<PG>
It's not that the dream doesn't bother me at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The word she used: 'Third Generation.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I think about what that word means―<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\翠眼呪殺.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Green-Eye Curse-Killing means a person who has green eyes, or a killing brought about by such a person.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, Green-Eye Curse-Killing could also be called the third generation, and the ones it applies to are me as I was until a little while ago, <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, and <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the ones who could be called the second generation are probably <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE>.<PG>
According to that book, once they reach their first period, they harbor intense murderous intent toward the second and third generations.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's why <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> doesn't have the intuition or the murderous intent yet, and why no murderous intent arose in me toward <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So, strictly speaking, they don't harbor murderous intent toward the second and third generations, but toward 'those who have the danger-sense ability.'<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Probably the same thing happened to <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE> in the past, and she was given falsificaso and settled down into how she is now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What happened with <STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee</STYLE>... maybe I'll ask <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE> about it...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂潜る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭抱える.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "4" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Daaamn! Why've you got that card!? You're totally cheating!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\紅葉のダンス.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you keep falling for the same trick every time!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Oh, you're back. How was it? Feel refreshed?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Yes, I'm fine now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">I'm thinking of going to talk to </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I see. Want me to come with you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"No, I'll go by myself. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">I think it'll probably be a complicated conversation..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mmm, I wanna hear it too. It's probably got something to do with me too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, take </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> with you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"...You're right. Understood."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yesterday <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> had looked at that book with me, so she had a rough idea of what was in it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But she didn't seem to have any real sense that someday she would feel murderous intent toward <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"My, my, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you're still going strong."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I'm telling you, that was an accident!"</STYLE><PG>
―When I stood outside the living room, I heard a strange conversation between a man and a woman.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One seemed to be <STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE>, but the other was the voice of a woman I didn't know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was this voice <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san's</STYLE>?<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, it really isn't like that! I wasn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="のぞ">peeping</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> or anything...!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "ごろごろゲームする日_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hee hee, I understand perfectly well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> both said it was an accident, didn't they?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"No, wait! At this rate I can't face </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　She'll beat me up again for sure..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Really, you worry too much... More importantly, we need to treat those injuries. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">My, my, your face is a wreck."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"My face was a wreck to begin with..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Okay, hold still. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Oh dear, your mouth's split a little, too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5"><TXSPS>"Ow-ow-ow-ow!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "100"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>"Now, bear with it, bear with it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Ngh... if </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> saw me like this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Don't hang on to silly pride. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Come on, turn around."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hey, what is this conversation about...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Probably </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Papa</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> got beaten to a pulp by </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, so </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mama's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> fixing up his injuries."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Did I really do something that bad...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It was pretty intense. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Enough to make even a mother bear run off barefoot..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Bears are barefoot to begin with..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Okay, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, legs next."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"H-hey, be a little gentler! That's the spot that hurts the most!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5"><TXSPS>　Ow-ow-ow-ow-ow!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "100"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>"If you yell that loud, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> will hear you."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I can already hear, though..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hey, me last night or me just now, which was more intense?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Pretty even..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Is that so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I take baths with </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Papa</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> sometimes, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you don't do that anymore?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Obviously I bathe by myself. I've grown up a fair amount."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"They sure were bouncing, boing-boing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Stop saying it like that..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But they're totally different from </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">my sister's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Chiga-nee's</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> aren't up to much?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, honestly, they're not up to much. I'm confident I'll pass her in another 3 years."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Is that so..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"How about </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">your sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, Goto-chan?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I wouldn't know... I only just talked to her properly for the first time in years."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If she's </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> sister, she must be boingy-boingy too, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hmm, I really couldn't say..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why've you been talking all polite for a while now?" [TN: Goto has slipped into 'ssu,' a casual polite ending]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I'm not quite sure..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Uuh... I knew it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> hates me, doesn't she... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Someone like me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"The way you sulk is just like </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">There, there, it's okay, it's okay. </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> will understand too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I heard a soft rub-rub as she stroked his head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With this atmosphere, it's way too awkward to go in...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe I'll wait until they're done treating his injuries.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ五島ツインテール挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "540" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MOTION "789" "人物1" "4" "140" "300" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">"The genius girl by her own and everyone's admission, Erika Goto, has arrived!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\五島エリカ.ogg" "BGM" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Whoa!"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Whoa!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suddenly an old woman in twin tails appeared right in front of us.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, what are you doing?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "1000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="11">"As you can see! I am cheering up </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">, who is down after a hard time, sir!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\日々と泉.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">The old woman</STYLE> flashed a big grin.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"What!? What happened!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Ow-ow-ow..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"Ohh...! So this is what has become of the sex offender who violated an </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="いたいけ">innocent</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> young girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Who are you calling a sex offender!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　And anyway, why is everyone here...!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　And anyway... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">Did you hear what we were saying just now?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that question, with all my might, I shook my head hard, straight-faced.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, matching my rhythm, shook her head hard, straight-faced, too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Uh... I was hoping to hear about what happened yesterday..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Oh, y-yeah... that's right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Uh... you really didn't hear anything?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> and I shook our heads hard, straight-faced, hair flying.
{PAUSE ""}
